        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Traditional Rope Style Refrigerator Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis very elegant design appliance pull is one of First Impressions Most Popular choices of all time. The highly detailed brackets and finials are the finest quality solid forged brass, made to last a lifetime.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor over 10 years, First Impressions has been designing and manufacturing beautiful custom decor for homes, right here is the U.S.A. They offer some of the most diverse and beautiful designs we carry.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panel. We believe a refrigerator needs to have a 18\" or longer pull installed to  effectively pull open todays large \"vacuum\" sealed doors such as the ones found on a Sub Zero refrigerator. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions CF833P-8 Rope Refrigerator Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 9</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/cf833P-detail-picture.jpg?v=1718159557\" target=\"new\"><b>FII-CF833P-8 Detailed View Picture</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 different standard lengths.</b>\r\n<li>FII-CF833P-8-20: Total Length 20\" - Center to Center Mount - 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CF833P-8-24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount - 17-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CF833P-8-30: Total Length 30\" - Center to Center Mount - 23-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CF833P-8-36: Total Length 36\" - Center to Center Mount - 29-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CF833P-8-45: Total Length 45\" - Center to Center Mount - 38-1/4\"</li>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This appliance pull can be made in <b>Custom Lengths</b>. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your size requirements.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\" thick  refrigerator/appliance door panel. Hand finished in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>* Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
